.TH PIXELENSD 1 "2026-07-20" "pixelens 0.1.0" "System Commands"
.SH NAME
pixelensd \- Pixelens background daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pixelensd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pixelensd
is the background daemon for Pixelens. It owns the global hotkey, performs
screen capture (slurp/grim or xdg-desktop-portal), runs OCR (tesseract),
dispatches to AI/search/upload, and drives the action menu. The CLI
.B pixelens
talks to it over a local IPC socket.
.PP
The daemon is shipped as a systemd user service
.I pixelensd.service
but is NOT enabled automatically. Enable it with:
.PP
systemctl --user enable --now pixelensd.service
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pixelens (1)
.SH AUTHOR
km-rjun
